sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Pengguna
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  U->>FE: isi form Register
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/auth/register
  API->>DB: insert users + bcrypt.hash
  API-->>FE: Set-Cookie token JWT httpOnly
  FE-->>U: onboarding lengkapi profil

  U->>FE: Login email + password
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/auth/login
  API->>DB: SELECT user + bcrypt.compare
  alt sukses
    API-->>FE: Set-Cookie token
    FE-->>U: dashboard / beranda
  else gagal
    API-->>FE: 401 Email atau password salah
    FE-->>U: Alert
  end

  U->>FE: buka halaman privat
  FE->>API: GET /api/mp/me cookie
  alt JWT valid
    API-->>FE: session user
  else tidak valid
    API-->>FE: 401
    FE-->>U: redirect /login
  end

  U->>FE: Logout
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/auth/logout
  API-->>FE: hapus cookie
